rn a list of columns which are instances of the specified classes.\n\nParameters\n----------\ncls : class or tuple thereof\n    Column class (including mixin) or tuple of Column classes.\n\nReturns\n-------\ncol_list : list of `Column`\n    List of Column objects which are instances of given classes.", "start_line": 330, "end_line": 345, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "not_isinstance", "qualified_name": "not_isinstance", "args": ["self", "cls"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Return a list of columns which are not instances of the specified classes.\n\nParameters\n----------\ncls : class or tuple thereof\n    Column class (including mixin) or tuple of Column classes.\n\nReturns\n-------\ncol_list : list of `Column`\n    List of Column objects which are not instances of given class", "start_line": 347, "end_line": 362, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__get__", "qualified_name": "__get__", "args": ["self", "instance", "owner_cls"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Get the attribute.\n\nThis normally returns an instance of this class which is stored on the\nowner object.", "start_line": 408, "end_line": 429, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__set__", "qualified_name": "__set__", "args": ["self", "instance", "names"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Set value of ``instance`` attribute to ``names``.\n\nParameters\n----------\ninstance : object\n    Instance that owns the attribute\nnames : None, str, list, tuple\n    Column name(s) to store, or None to clear", "start_line": 431, "end_line": 449, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__call__", "qualified_name": "__call__", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Get the value of the attribute.\n\nReturns\n-------\nnames : None, tuple\n    Include/exclude names", "start_line": 451, "end_line": 461, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__repr__", "qualified_name": "__repr__", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_l