ring the result\nof its computation in the ``__dict__`` of the object instance.  This is\nuseful for computing the value of some property that should otherwise be\ninvariant.  Fo", "start_line": 788, "end_line": 859}, {"name": "sharedmethod", "bases": ["classmethod"], "methods": ["__get__", "_make_method"], "docstring": "This is a method decorator that allows both an instancemethod and a\n`classmethod` to share the same name.\n\nWhen using `sharedmethod` on a method defined in a class's body, it\nmay be called on an instance, or on a class.  In the former case it\nbehaves like a normal instance method (a reference to the", "start_line": 862, "end_line": 926}], "calls": [], "module_docstring": "Sundry function and class decorators.", "parse_error": ""}, {"file_path": "astropy/utils/data_info.py", "file_hash": "3a612fc4f3c9f233aebf9eb17d7c82073bddc7e72de3f65e472fb6d1c313a665", "imports": [{"module": "os", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": ""}, {"module": "re", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": ""}, {"module": "sys", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": ""}, {"module": "warnings", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": ""}, {"module": "weakref", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": ""}, {"module": "collections", "names": ["OrderedDict"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "contextlib", "names": ["contextmanager"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "copy", "names": ["deepcopy"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "functools", "names": ["partial"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "io", "names": ["StringIO"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "numpy", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": "np"}, {"module": "", "names": ["metadata"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.table.sorted_array", "names": ["SortedArray"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.table.np_utils", "names": ["TableMergeError"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.table", "names": ["groups"], "is_from