sity_scale"], "docstring": "FLRW cosmology with a CPL dark energy equation of state and curvature.\n\nThe equation for the dark energy equation of state uses the\nCPL form as described in Chevallier & Polarski [1]_ and Linder [2]_:\n:math:`w(z) = w_0 + w_a (1-a) = w_0 + w_a z / (1+z)`.\n\nParameters\n----------\nH0 : float or scalar q", "start_line": 17, "end_line": 213}, {"name": "Flatw0waCDM", "bases": ["FlatFLRWMixin", "w0waCDM"], "methods": ["__init__"], "docstring": "FLRW cosmology with a CPL dark energy equation of state and no\ncurvature.\n\nThe equation for the dark energy equation of state uses the CPL form as\ndescribed in Chevallier & Polarski [1]_ and Linder [2]_:\n:math:`w(z) = w_0 + w_a (1-a) = w_0 + w_a z / (1+z)`.\n\nParameters\n----------\nH0 : float or scala", "start_line": 216, "end_line": 347}], "calls": [], "module_docstring": "", "parse_error": ""}, {"file_path": "astropy/cosmology/flrw/base.py", "file_hash": "d75e4e69bdc6d4d61ddaf630ff88f1eabb44867f58377e64d2259e2d2e49826d", "imports": [{"module": "__future__", "names": ["annotations"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "warnings", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": ""}, {"module": "abc", "names": ["abstractmethod"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "math", "names": ["exp", "floor", "log", "pi", "sqrt"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "numbers", "names": ["Number"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "typing", "names": ["TYPE_CHECKING", "Any", "TypeVar"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "numpy", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": "np"}, {"module": "numpy", "names": ["inf", "sin"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.constants", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": "const"}, {"module": "astropy.units", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": "u"}, {"module": "astropy.cosmology.core", "names": ["Cosmology", "FlatCosmologyMixin"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.cosmology.parameter", "names": ["Parameter"]