` instances cannot be cast into `Quantity`\nobjects.  A failure in this test could be related to failures\nin subsequent tests.", "start_line": 185, "end_line": 192, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_physical_type_operations", "qualified_name": "test_physical_type_operations", "args": ["left", "right", "operator", "expected"], "decorators": ["pytest.mark.parametrize('left, right, operator, expected', operation_parameters)"], "docstring": "Test that `PhysicalType` dunder methods that require another\nargument behave as intended.", "start_line": 247, "end_line": 252, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_physical_type_as_set", "qualified_name": "test_physical_type_as_set", "args": ["unit", "expected_set"], "decorators": ["pytest.mark.parametrize('unit, expected_set', unit_with_physical_type_set)"], "docstring": "Test making a `physical.PhysicalType` instance into a `set`.", "start_line": 263, "end_line": 266, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_physical_type_iteration", "qualified_name": "test_physical_type_iteration", "args": [], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Test iterating through different physical type names.", "start_line": 269, "end_line": 272, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_physical_type_in", "qualified_name": "test_physical_type_in", "args": [], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Test that `in` works as expected for `PhysicalType` objects with one\nor multiple names.", "start_line": 275, "end_line": 281, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_physical_type_instance_equality", "qualified_name": "test_physical_type_instance_equality", "args": ["unit1", "unit2"], "decorators": ["pytest.mark.parametrize('unit1, unit2', equivalent_unit_pairs)"], "docstring": "Test that `physical.PhysicalType` instances for units of the same\ndimensionality are equal.", "start_line": 298, "end_line": 304, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_get_physical_type_equivalent_