, "docstring": "", "start_line": 314, "end_line": 315}], "calls": [], "module_docstring": "This is the APE5 coordinates API document re-written to work as a series of test\nfunctions.\n\nNote that new tests for coordinates functionality should generally *not* be\nadded to this file - instead, add them to other appropriate test modules  in\nthis package, like ``test_sky_coord.py``, ``test_frames.py``, or\n``test_representation.py``.  This file is instead meant mainly to keep track of\ndeviations from the original APE5 plan.", "parse_error": ""}, {"file_path": "astropy/coordinates/tests/test_solar_system.py", "file_hash": "3425be4498b58bedb29338d8ddc1db276fcff5a6028019f08a7c77fc85a1f511", "imports": [{"module": "os", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": ""}, {"module": "urllib.error", "names": ["HTTPError"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "numpy", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": "np"}, {"module": "pytest", "names": [], "is_from": false, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy", "names": ["units"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.constants", "names": ["c"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.coordinates.builtin_frames", "names": ["TETE"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.coordinates.earth", "names": ["EarthLocation"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.coordinates.funcs", "names": ["get_sun"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.coordinates.representation", "names": ["CartesianRepresentation", "UnitSphericalRepresentation"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.coordinates.sky_coordinate", "names": ["SkyCoord"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.coordinates.solar_system", "names": ["BODY_NAME_TO_KERNEL_SPEC", "_get_apparent_body_position", "get_body", "get_body_barycentric", "get_body_barycentric_posvel", "get_moon", "solar_system_ephemeris"], "is_from": true, "alias": ""}, {"module": "astropy.tests.helper", "names": ["assert_quantity_allcl