: ["qdp_file", "input_colnames", "delimiter"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Get all tables from a QDP file.\n\nParameters\n----------\nqdp_file : str\n    Input QDP file name\n\nOther Parameters\n----------------\ninput_colnames : list of str\n    Name of data columns (defaults to ['col1', 'col2', ...]), _not_\n    including error columns.\ndelimiter : str\n    Delimiter for the values ", "start_line": 237, "end_line": 342, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_understand_err_col", "qualified_name": "_understand_err_col", "args": ["colnames"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Get which column names are error columns.\n\nExamples\n--------\n>>> colnames = ['a', 'a_err', 'b', 'b_perr', 'b_nerr']\n>>> serr, terr = _understand_err_col(colnames)\n>>> np.allclose(serr, [1])\nTrue\n>>> np.allclose(terr, [2])\nTrue\n>>> serr, terr = _understand_err_col(['a', 'a_nerr'])\nTraceback (most rec", "start_line": 345, "end_line": 382, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_read_table_qdp", "qualified_name": "_read_table_qdp", "args": ["qdp_file", "names", "table_id", "delimiter"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Read a table from a QDP file.\n\nParameters\n----------\nqdp_file : str\n    Input QDP file name\n\nOther Parameters\n----------------\nnames : list of str\n    Name of data columns (defaults to ['col1', 'col2', ...]), _not_\n    including error columns.\n\ntable_id : int, default 0\n    Number of the table to be", "start_line": 385, "end_line": 422, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_write_table_qdp", "qualified_name": "_write_table_qdp", "args": ["table", "filename", "err_specs"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Write a table to a QDP file.\n\nParameters\n----------\ntable : :class:`~astropy.table.Table`\n    Input table to be written\nfilename : str\n    Output QDP file name\n\nOther Parameters\n----------------\nerr_specs : dict\n    Dictionary of the format {'serr': [1], 'terr': [2, 3]}, specifying\n    which columns", "start_